<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firm seeks tenders for wheat, soybean.</title>
<headline>Philippine firm seeks tenders for wheat, soybean.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine flour mill is seeking tenders for 7,500 tonnes of wheat and 15,000 tonnes of soybean, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The traders said the wheat and soybean were for April shipment.</p>
<p>The tenders are to be submitted late today, they said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
